From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EvilMetaMonkey <hood.mj85@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:11:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add dmc disable and JSON hooks status

dmc disable [--apply] [--json --schema-version 1] removes only dmc's own
agent hooks and stops the watcher. It checks every config file the
installer supports (the workspace's project and local files and the user
files), finds handlers of the form "<dmc> agent-hook <agent> <event>" for
this dmc build and others, and removes them with the exact-match
uninstall, writing each file back in its original layout (or removing a
file dmc created). .dmc/, every checkpoint and other tools' hooks are
untouched. Preview by default; re-enable with dmc hooks install.

dmc hooks status takes --json --schema-version 1, and capabilities lists
hooks.status and disable (additive).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
